Yes, we can request that Wikimedia change our logo. Actually, we had a request waiting unfulfilled for a long time that they alter it to make the letters lowercase, although I put this officially on hold a while back because there was, at the time, an active dispute about whether it should be written {uikipedias} or {uikipEdi,as}. So, I'm happy to poke someone in the System to try to actually get the logo changed, but let's make sure to have a consensus version of what we want to so we don't need to change it again (FYI, nobody seems to be pushing for {uikipEdi,as} anymore, so I guess {uikipedias} wins by acquiescence).

The rest can be solved through normal editing (well, {stika}-{galfi} requires an admin). I did always think {fi'i do vi la .uikipedias.} sounded a bit odd.

By the way, thanks to Yanis for translating the rest of the interface. Great work!

Cheers,

sen

